&\frac{c}{c_{s}}=1-\operatorname{erf}(2.083), \therefore 1-\frac{c}{c_{s}}=0.9964 \\
&\frac{c}{c_{s}}=3.6 \times 10^{-3}, \therefore c=2.88 \times 10^{16} \mathrm{~cm}^{-3}
